#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:7 8ace34b3f3e54fb3a2bfed24db3d435c
msgid "准备环境与数据，完成第一次知识追踪实验。"
msgstr ""
"Prepare the environment and data, then run your first knowledge tracing "
