#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:10 0b33f904fbbb4bee99d6835b0f9e06bc
msgid "[快速上手](quick-start.md)：以 ASSISTments 2009 和 DKT 为例，完成数据处理、训练与评估。"
msgstr ""
"[Quick Start](quick-start.md): Walk through data processing, training, "
"and evaluation using ASSISTments 2009 and DKT."

#~ msgid "快速上手"
#~ msgstr "Getting started"

#~ msgid "UniKT 是一个基于 PyTorch 和 PyTorch Geometric 构建的统一知识追踪研究实验框架。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "UniKT is a unified research and "
#~ "experimentation framework for knowledge "
#~ "tracing, built on PyTorch and PyTorch"
#~ " Geometric."

#~ msgid "什么是知识追踪"
#~ msgstr "What is knowledge tracing"

#~ msgid "知识追踪是对学习者的知识状态随时间进行建模的任务，基于其历史交互数据（回答的题目、练习的技能以及正确性结果）。其目标是预测学习者在未来题目上的表现，从而实现个性化学习。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Knowledge tracing is the task of "
#~ "modeling a learner's knowledge state "
#~ "over time based on their historical "
#~ "interaction data (questions answered, skills"
#~ " practiced, and correctness outcomes). Its"
#~ " goal is to predict the learner's "
#~ "future performance on questions, enabling "
#~ "personalized learning."

#~ msgid "UniKT 提供的功能"
#~ msgstr "What UniKT provides"

#~ msgid "UniKT 提供从数据到评估的完整流程："
#~ msgstr "UniKT covers the complete pipeline from data to evaluation:"

#~ msgid "**统一 API**：使用相同的 CLI 和训练器 API 训练任何模型"
#~ msgstr "**Unified API**: train any model with the same CLI and trainer API"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**35 "
#~ "个内置模型**：覆盖图神经网络（GKT、GIKT、SGKT、DyGKT、HDHKT）和序列/注意力架构（DKT、AKT、SimpleKT）等方向"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**35 built-in models**: covering graph"
#~ " neural networks (GKT, GIKT, SGKT, "
#~ "DyGKT, HDHKT) and sequential/attention "
#~ "architectures (DKT, AKT, SimpleKT), among "
#~ "others"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**11 "
#~ "个支持的数据集**：ASSISTments（2009/2012/2015/2017）、Algebra（2005/2006）、Bridge2006"
#~ "、EdNet-KT1、Junyi、NIPS2020_T34、Slepemapy"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**11 supported datasets**: ASSISTments "
#~ "(2009/2012/2015/2017), Algebra (2005/2006), "
#~ "Bridge2006, EdNet-KT1, Junyi, NIPS2020_T34,"
#~ " and Slepemapy"

#~ msgid "**实验管理**：K 折交叉验证、超参数搜索（Optuna）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Experiment management**: K-fold cross "
#~ "validation, hyperparameter search (Optuna)"

#~ msgid "框架设计"
#~ msgstr "Framework design"

#~ msgid "UniKT 通过装饰器自动发现模型、训练器、数据源和配置——只需在代码中添加一行装饰器，无需手动编辑注册文件。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "UniKT auto-discovers models, trainers, "
#~ "data sources, and configurations via "
#~ "decorators — just add a single "
#~ "decorator line in your code, with "
#~ "no need to manually edit registration"
#~ " files."
